<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson sees more Chinese AXE orders.</title>
<headline>Ericsson sees more Chinese AXE orders.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications group AB LM Ericsson said on Monday it expected more orders from China for mobile AXE switches.</p>
<p>&quot;The plan is that China will have this type of unit in each province and with all likelihood we will be in on this as it continues,&quot; Johan Sandberg, Ericsson marketing spokesman for the Asia-Pacific region, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Ericsson announced on Monday a contract together with Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo for seven mobile AXE switches from China's Post and Telecommunications Ministry.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1008</p>
